# Trust the nixConfig of flakes evaluated from this tree (the Cachix
# substituter in nixos/flake.nix) without prompting, so ad-hoc nix commands
# here use the cache. Scoped by direnv to this directory: nix.conf is not
# touched, so builds elsewhere never query the cache. Non-direnv users are
# unaffected: nix still asks them. The devShell is deliberately not loaded
# here (`use flake`), since its shellHook exports the Cachix push token.
export NIX_CONFIG="accept-flake-config = true"
